# Local Project Rules

These rules are local to this repository. Do not copy them to global `~/.claude` or global Codex/Cursor configuration without explicit user approval.

## React, TypeScript, and Logging

### Logging

- Methods: `log.debug()`, `log.info()`, `log.warn()`, `log.error()`, `log.success()`.

### TypeScript

- Platform files resolve as `.web.ts`, `.electron.ts`, `.ts` for native.

## Styling and Theming

This project uses Uniwind with Tailwind CSS v4. Theme variables are defined in `apps/main/global.css` using OKLCH color space.

### Theme Switching and Native Issues

- Some native components do not update styles on theme switch due to CSS variable lag.
- If styles look stuck, use `log.debug` to verify current theme state.

## Translations

`packages/core/src/contexts/translations/locales/en/core.json` is the single source of English.
It is statically bundled as the `en` resource with `fallbackLng: 'en'`, so a key always resolves
there — an inline `defaultValue` is never read at runtime and only creates drift.

- `pnpm translations:check` fails CI when a literal `t()` key is missing from `en/core.json`.
   Run it after adding keys.
